WEBVTT

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:00.458
Why didn't I?

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:04.083
Because of the shame.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.934
Because of that feeling inside

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:12.768
telling me that what happened
to me was my fault.

00:01:12.792 --> 00:01:15.059
We all hear that voice sometimes.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:16.976
It tells us things like,

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.643
you are aren't good enough,

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.208
you aren't smart enough ...

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.917
you can't give a TED talk.

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:25.434
We hear that voice,

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:27.833
and it becomes difficult
to hear anything else.

00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:32.476
We begin to agonize over
what other people will think of us --